# teleportMannequin(Player player, Double x, Double z)
# Teleports the mannequin entity to absolute world (x, curY, z) using
# the current yaw and pitch from per-player state. The mannequin is a
# regular server-side entity, so /tp is the right tool here - we are
# NOT writing transformation.translation (that's display-entity-only).
# Smoothness comes from the 20 Hz teleport rate plus the server/client
# interpolation of standard entity moves.

@using mannequin
@fast

@bypass /minecraft:tp @e[tag=mannequin_rychess,limit=1] {{x}} {{curY[player]}} {{z}} {{curYawDeg[player]}} {{curPitchDeg[player]}}
